<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts Zoran.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts Zoran.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Zoran Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $0.70 a share from $0.89.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 earnings estimate of $1.20 a share.</p>
<p>-- Zoran lost 2 to 25-1/2 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
